The claimant tendered his affidavit in evidence vide Ex.WW1/A bearing his signatures at point 'A' & 'B' and relied on documents as follows:-
a) Office copy of Complaint dated 04.12.2019 to Assistant Labour Commissioner vide Ex.WW1/1;
b) Office copy of demand notice dated 03.12.2019 sent by workman to the management vide Ex.WW1/2;
c) Postal receipts vide Ex.WW1/3 and Ex.WW1/4;
d) Statement of claim dated 09.12.2019 filed by the workman before Labour Office vide Ex.WW1/5;
e) ID card of workman issued by Management vide Ex.WW1/6 (OSR).
16.
